// The list of F (elastic) constitutive models the mixed F/J MPM force supports.
//
// This is an X-macro list: include it after defining FJMIXED_F_MODEL(Model).
// It drives BOTH the runtime dispatch in FJMixedForce.h AND the explicit
// addFJMaterial<Model, QuadraticVolumePenalty> instantiations in
// Lib/MPM/instantiations/MpmParticleRange3d.cpp.
//
// To add an elastic model to the coupling: add its header to
// Physics/ConstitutiveModel/ (auto-picked-up umbrella + globbed .cpp) and add
// one FJMIXED_F_MODEL(YourModel) line here, then rebuild. Nothing else.
//
// Model is the bare class template name; the T/dim are supplied by the includer.
FJMIXED_F_MODEL(CorotatedIsotropic)
FJMIXED_F_MODEL(LinearCorotated)
FJMIXED_F_MODEL(PDIsotropic)
